==Battleground==
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Neko Hakase (Enemy)|Neko Hakase]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

